    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1562">

                <pb facs="1161" n="1045" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1045"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.52/674.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Spanish
                    Ambassador</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-10-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 8, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your telegram October 6. Appropriate instructions have been sent Department’s
                    representative at Vera Cruz regarding restoration property of Teresian and Jesus
                    Maria Colleges in Yucatan.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
